 "sq": [
  {
   "_id": 13254,
   "ANSWER": "<ul data-end=\"2711\" data-start=\"2570\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2893\" data-start=\"2819\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3003\" data-start=\"2778\">A firewall is a security system that monitors and controls incoming and outgoing network traffic based on predefined rules.<br data-end=\"2920\" data-start=\"2917\" />\n\t<strong data-end=\"2930\" data-start=\"2920\">Types:</strong> Packet-filtering firewall, Stateful inspection firewall, Proxy firewall.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 3,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1",
    "PLO2",
    "PLO3",
    "PLO4",
    "PLO13",
    "PLO12"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Define <strong data-end=\"2749\" data-start=\"2737\">firewall</strong> and mention any two types.</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 509,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 13254
  },
  {
   "_id": 13255,
   "ANSWER": "<ul data-end=\"2711\" data-start=\"2570\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2893\" data-start=\"2819\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3003\" data-start=\"2778\">RBAC assigns access rights based on user roles. Users are grouped into roles, and roles have permissions.<br data-end=\"1969\" data-start=\"1966\" />\n\t<strong data-end=\"1981\" data-start=\"1969\">Example:</strong> Database Admin role has permissions to create and delete databases, while Developer role only has read/write access.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 3,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1",
    "PLO2",
    "PLO3",
    "PLO4",
    "PLO13",
    "PLO12"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Explain <strong data-end=\"1826\" data-start=\"1790\">Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)</strong> with an example.</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 509,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 13255
  }
