 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 13262,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"8111\" data-start=\"7758\"><strong data-end=\"7771\" data-start=\"7760\">Answer Key:</strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"2831\" data-start=\"2257\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2383\" data-start=\"2270\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2383\" data-start=\"2273\"><strong data-end=\"2281\" data-start=\"2273\">DAC:</strong> Access rights managed by resource owners.<br data-end=\"2326\" data-start=\"2323\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2339\" data-start=\"2329\">Example:</em> File permissions set by users in Windows.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2507\" data-start=\"2384\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2507\" data-start=\"2387\"><strong data-end=\"2395\" data-start=\"2387\">MAC:</strong> System-enforced labels define access.<br data-end=\"2436\" data-start=\"2433\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2449\" data-start=\"2439\">Example:</em> Top Secret, Secret classifications in military systems.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2645\" data-start=\"2508\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2645\" data-start=\"2511\"><strong data-end=\"2520\" data-start=\"2511\">RBAC:</strong> Permissions assigned to roles, users assigned roles.<br data-end=\"2576\" data-start=\"2573\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2589\" data-start=\"2579\">Example:</em> HR role can access employee records in an ERP system.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2787\" data-start=\"2646\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2787\" data-start=\"2649\"><strong data-end=\"2679\" data-start=\"2649\">Rule-Based Access Control:</strong> Decisions based on predefined rules.<br data-end=\"2719\" data-start=\"2716\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2732\" data-start=\"2722\">Example:</em> Firewall rules allowing HTTP traffic and blocking FTP.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
